Interview Questions - AWS Fundamentals
Q1. Why use AWS instead of traditional data centres?
Answer:
AWS provides:
	• Faster infrastructure provisioning 
	• Global availability 
	• Elastic scaling 
	• Pay-as-you-go pricing 
	• Managed services 
	• Reduced hardware maintenance 

